{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "25", "m": "10", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "23", "M": "39", "S": "32"}}, "news": [{"title": "Delhi court upholds cheating case against M3M, its promoters in \u20b9450-crore land dispute", "para": "A Delhi court has upheld cheating and criminal conspiracy proceedings against M3M India Pvt Ltd and its promoters. The case involves allegations of a Rs 450-crore land fraud related to a land exchange deal. Allegations state that M3M obtained land without paying the required consideration according to the agreement. The court directed the accused to appear before the chief judicial magistrate on October 27.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/delhi-court-upholds-cheating-case-against-m3m-its-promoters-in-450-crore-land-dispute/135191673?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-72836/135191673.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "Bombay HC junks order for further EOW probe against developer in Mumbai redevelopment case", "para": "The Bombay High Court overturned a magistrate's directive for further inquiry into a developer. Previously, the economic offences wing had closed the investigation due to a lack of substantial evidence. The developer argued that the complainant, Vinod Jain, had a record of frivolous complaints, with two earlier probes finding no validity in Jain's claims.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/bombay-hc-junks-order-for-further-eow-probe-against-developer-in-mumbai-redevelopment-case/135187067?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-1094538/135187067.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "Hyderabad development body banks on Neopolis auctions for \u20b92,000 crore haul", "para": "Next month, the Hyderabad Metropolitan Development Authority is set to auction off 114 land parcels, with a target of raising around Rs 2,000 crore. Prime areas under consideration include Kokapet, Raidurg, and Banjara Hills, which are expected to garner significant interest. The auction features parcels with established reserve prices, particularly spotlighting Kokapet's Neopolis layout.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/hyderabad-development-body-banks-on-neopolis-auctions-for-2000-crore-haul/135185953?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-329688/135185953.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}]}